# Route: guide 19 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 39 to
# 41, 40 quests, 1.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ironforge, Stormwind City, The Barrens, Westfall): Ironforge -> near
# Ironforge -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> near Stormwind City -> near
# Stormwind -> Stormwind City -> Ratchet -> The Dagger Hills.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Save Techbot's Brain! (2922;
# Techbot 26); The Black Box (708; Zaricotl 55-56); The Star, the Hand and the
# Heart (735; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying
# 44); The Shattered Necklace (2198; Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge
# Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37,
# Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave Hunter 36-37); The Perenolde Tiara
# (543; Grel'borg the Miser 39); A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen Battleguard
# 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 866 Root
# Samples; 3633 Goblin Engineering; 3634 Gnome Engineering; 3646 Membership
# Card Renewal.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps
# (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The
# Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
